Description: Kavis Settings — system settings application (madde 9)
 A single window in the Windows 11 Settings layout: a searchable
 section list on the left, content on the right. Appearance, display,
 sound, keyboard/language, power, network, taskbar and system sections.
 .
 Single configuration file ~/.config/kavis/kavis.conf; the panel and
 the theme read the same file. Translations come from the "kavis"
 domain shipped by kavis-panel.
